    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lwa būkenaagūji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkanizīīla hangī gūniwīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū bebe yaya ū kūtoola, ūtizūbyala baana bagosha na bakīma ū ng'wipandī lyenīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo alīgūhaya kūlwa baana a bagosha na a bakīma abo bakūbyalagwa ū ng'wipandī lyenīlī, na a bakīma a baninabo, na a bagosha a basabo; gūlī gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bakūbūlagwa mabūsatu mabi; atilonga wa kūbalīla nūūlū kūbajīka; bakūbiza gītī ndeelya jisambaalile sagala sagala ū mu mabbaala. Bakūcha bo lūshū na nzala; ī mibimba yabo īkūbiza shilīwa sha noni ja kūlala na sha mashiinū ga mu masaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Yaya kwingīla mu numba ūmo balīīlya shilīwa sha ha lūfu, nūūlū ūtizūja kūbalangamīla na kūlīla ng'hūngū, nūūlū kūboolekeja kūsaatwa kwako; nguno a banhū benabo naabīngīgije ī mhola nū būtogwa, nī shigongo shane.” Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bose pye, bataale na bado, bakūshila kūcha ū mu sī yenīyī; alīyo batūjīkwa, na atilonga wa kūbalīla, nūūlū wa kwisananga, nūūlū kwihalūla ipala kūlwa nguno yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atilonga wa kūfunya shilīwa shakwe kūlwa kūbalūngūja abo balīīlīla ng'hūngū; nūūlū ni kūbinha sha kūng'wa kūlwa kūbageheja būpīna nguno ya kūchīlwa baninabo nūūlū basaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū mu numba ya shigukulu yaya ū kwingīla, gīkī ūkigashe kūlya na kūng'wa hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, A malaka ga būyegi na seko, na a ga batooji na batoolwa, nakūgahuumūja ū mu shikū jing'we jenīji mulībona hape hape; gakooya ū kwigwiwa ū ng'wipandī lyenīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba ūlū ūbasomboolela pyī ī mihayo yenīyī bakūkūbūūja gīkī, “Nibūlī ū SEEBA watūtūūlīlile mayanga mabi gīko? Twankenije kī? Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise twang'wītīlile shibi kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ūkūbawīla gīkī, ‘Īlī kūlwa nguno a bataale bing'we baalī banileka ū nene,’ alīhaya SEEBA, ‘būlondeela bamulungu bangī būyūbatūmamīla na kūbalamya. Ū nene būnīība, nī shilagilo shane booya ū kūshidima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bīng'we hū mukwītaga ya malofu no, kūtinda īyo bīītaga a bataale bing'we. Manīlagi dūhū ī gīkī būlī ūmò wing'we akūshimīzīlaga mu būgang'hanazu wa ng'holò yakwe yabūbi, a ha ng'wanya gwa kūniigwa ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, nakūmuponya ng'winge ū mu sī yenīyī, muje kū sī īyo mutīmanile a bing'we, pye na bataale bingwe baalī batīmanile. Hūna ū kwenūko mukūyūbatūmamīla bamulungu bangī līīmi na būjikū; nguno ū nene natūmuchīla shigongo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Jikūshika shikū, a banhū bakooya ū kūhaya gīkī, ‘Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo akabenha Baisilaeli kūfuma mu sī ya Misili.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bakūyūhaya, ‘Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo akabenha Baisilaeli kūfuma kū sī ya sukuma, na kūfuma kū sī jose ūko walī wabaponya!’ Nguno nakūbashosha ū mu sī yabo īyo naalī nabinha bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha nakūlagīja bazubi bingī babazube, alīhaya SEEBA, hanuma ya henaho nakūtūma bahwīmi bingī bize baje bakūbahwīmaga hose pyī ū mu ngūlū ī nhaale nī ndo, nū mu mahalo ga shiganga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A miso gane gajibonile pyī ī nzīla jabo; jitibisile ū kūlī nene, nūūlū ī shibi shabo shitashīkījiwe ū kū miso gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyo ībigeleelilwe kūlwa būbī na shibi shabo nakūbashokeja nīyo na kūtinda ho. Nguno ī sī yane bīsosohaja na mibimba ya shiikolile shabo sha malofu; ū wingīji wane būbookaja shiitongelegejo shabo sh'ipelanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
